&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beast Industries is a multifaceted media and entertainment company founded by Jimmy Donaldson, popularly known as MrBeast, the most watched person in the world. Renowned for revolutionizing digital content creation, Beast Industries encompasses a diverse portfolio of ventures that extend far beyond its origins on YouTube. With a mission to entertain, inspire, and create significant social impact, Beast Industries operates across various domains including digital media, philanthropy, consumer products, and innovative business initiatives. At Beast Industries, we believe in the transformative power of digital media and its potential to entertain, educate, and effect positive change. Our commitment to innovation, creativity, and philanthropy drives us to explore new frontiers, create unforgettable experiences, and build a legacy that inspires future generations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;Account Director, Strategist, Agency&lt;/strong&gt; at &lt;strong&gt;MrBeast&lt;/strong&gt;, you are the senior strategist who owns the pre-sale phase of agency-sourced integrations in the MrBeast ecosystem. Your primary client is a holding-company agency team: media planners, integrated strategists, and activation leads at agencies (e.g.; Publicis, Omnicom, WPP, IPG, dentsu, or the independents), who are themselves servicing their own marketer clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are the person they trust to bring MrBeast into their client&#39;s plan credibly, and the person who translates their client&#39;s brief into a MrBeast content architecture that survives both agency scrutiny and marketer approval.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in New York, where you’ll work in-office five days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spearhead pre-sale strategies: craft compelling pitch decks, concept docs, KPI models, and custom pricing frameworks tailored to agency briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate holding-company dynamics with agility, seamlessly adapting pitches to fit diverse RFP processes and agency workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transform complex marketer goals into high-impact MrBeast content integration opportunities that exceed expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design agency-ready packaging, including custom case studies, audience-sizing data, and flexible creative executions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple high-priority accounts simultaneously in a fast-paced, high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver post-campaign insights, measurement snapshots, and&amp;nbsp; pitch-ready anonymized wins to empower partners to win future campaigns with us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of experience in media-agency-side integrated marketing strategy, brand-side media planning, or platform and publisher partnerships focused on agency channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native holding-company literacy. You’ve worked at, sold into, or sourced from at least three of the major holding companies, and you know the difference between how GroupM approaches an RFP and how Omnicom Media Group does.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of packaging integrated campaigns for agency-sourced clients, either from the publisher side (network, streamer, platform sales) or from the agency side (media planning, integrated strategy).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Media literacy. You should be able to specify what a MrBeast integration looks like without needing Production to explain it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating in a higher-volume environment with multiple concurrent deals in motion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fixed annual salary of &lt;strong&gt;$178,000 - $223,000&lt;/strong&gt; plus an annual bonus, an employee equity plan grant, and comprehensive benefits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Equity grants are issued in good faith, subject to company policies, board approval, and individual eligibility.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Perks, Why Work On the MrBeast Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are redefining what entertainment and storytelling look like at global scale. Every piece of content we publish reaches millions and influences culture in real time. This is your opportunity to lead the team that decides how those moments come to life across every screen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous Medical (Blue Cross Blue Shield), Dental, Vision and company-paid Life Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company contributions to employee Health Savings Accounts (HSA)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401k Plan with Safe Harbor company-matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible vacation policy and paid company holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-provided technology package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation assistance where applicable, including travel and company-provided housing for the first 90 days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
