&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At MrBeast, Creative is 3 things. What we think will happen, what actually happens, and the best story we tell of what happened. As a Director, you are accountable for all three.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You will unmatched ownership over various video projects at various stages, making real-time decisions to protect the creative vision from the kick-off with title and thumbnail through the final edit. You work with the creatives in pre-production to make the best outline of the video possible through concepts, testing, and formats. On set, you will make vital creative decisions that shape the video. This involves real-time writing, problem-solving, and collaborating with production, talent, and contestants, all while keeping the viewer&#39;s experience in mind. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You will also participate actively in post-production reviews, working to leave notes and feedback to&amp;nbsp;ensure the final product is exceptional.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You are the single source of creative truth for your projects, ensuring that the hundreds of decisions made during production align with the core creative vision.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
