&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Lead writing sessions for unique ideas and situations &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Research trends and tactics for retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
