&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beast Industries is a multifaceted media and entertainment company founded by Jimmy Donaldson, popularly known as MrBeast, the most watched person in the world. Renowned for revolutionizing digital content creation, Beast Industries encompasses a diverse portfolio of ventures that extend far beyond its origins on YouTube. With a mission to entertain, inspire, and create significant social impact, Beast Industries operates across various domains including digital media, philanthropy, consumer products, and innovative business initiatives. At Beast Industries, we believe in the transformative power of digital media and its potential to entertain, educate, and effect positive change. Our commitment to innovation, creativity, and philanthropy drives us to explore new frontiers, create unforgettable experiences, and build a legacy that inspires future generations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Science Lead, Global Creator Platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beast Industries is building the operating system for creator monetization — the connective tissue between the world&#39;s biggest creators and the brands that want to reach their audiences. Vyro is our brand-creator marketplace, and we believe there&#39;s a real opportunity to do something here that no one else in the space is set up to do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Where&#39;s the real incrementality — and how much is it worth?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re hiring a Data Science Lead, reporting to the CTO, to design and run the experiments that will help us answer it. You’ll start as a senior individual contributor and help build a quant team over time. You&#39;ll build a portfolio of incrementality tests, lift studies, measurement frameworks, and whatever else helps drive the platform forwards. You should expect many of our strongest beliefs about creator marketing to be wrong - a key part of this role is designing experiments that overturn assumptions and help us discover what actually drives outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an early role on a new team still finding its shape. You&#39;ll work directly with leadership, sit close to the engineers and product people building Vyro, and have a direct line to the creative talent that powers Beast. You&#39;ll be one of the people figuring this out from scratch, alongside the team behind the most-watched creator on the planet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help us run our first real campaigns and learn from them — fast. Design tests that get useful answers in weeks and tighten the methodology with each iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the measurement playbook as we go: holdouts, geo-experiments, matched markets, retargeting studies, creative variant testing — picking the right tool for the question in front of us, not the most elegant one in the textbook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our buy-side operators on retargeting strategy, turning campaign exposure data into audiences and quantifying what those audiences are worth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate findings into clear, brand-facing case studies and internal product decisions, and iterate to sharpen the next sales conversation or product bet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption of measurement frameworks across sales, creator partnerships, and leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with creators, creative leads, sales, and engineering. Help generate and evaluate hypotheses about what makes sponsored content actually convert: pacing, placement, call-to-action, narrative integration, and the subtler factors no one has quantified yet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help us figure out where creator data should and shouldn&#39;t flow and determine where our long-term advantage lives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In your first 6-12 months, you&#39;ll have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established the measurement foundations needed to support experimentation, attribution, and campaign performance analysis, including instrumentation, core datasets, and data quality standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designed and shipped Vyro&#39;s first incrementality studies across our earliest brand campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Authored a measurement playbook our sales team uses in brand conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established the baseline metrics leadership uses to evaluate creator-brand match quality and platform ROI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Built the foundation of a quant practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of professional experience in data science, ad measurement, or a similar analytics role with a strong emphasis on providing experiments that shipped and influenced decisions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to independently scope, execute, and communicate analytical work in ambiguous environments with limited existing infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python/R for statistical analysis and modelling, and fluency in SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data collection, APIs, and integration requirements across digital platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical working knowledge of incrementality testing, causal inference fundamentals, and the limits of last-click attribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in one of the following environments: (a) a platform creator-monetization or partnerships team, (b) a measurement / incrementality / MMM vendor, (c) an in-house or agency brand measurement team running creator or influencer programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and data presentation skills to varied stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s Degree in Data Science, Statistics, Math, Computer Science, or related&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cross-platform measurement — quantifying lift when the same campaign runs on YouTube and TikTok and Meta.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve shipped a real geo-experiment or matched-market test in the wild and have opinions about why most of them are designed badly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve worked closely with creators or talent before and understand that the creative side of this work matters as much as the math.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The target total compensation ranges from &lt;strong&gt;$150,000 to 200,000&lt;/strong&gt;,&amp;nbsp;an employee equity plan grant, bonus, plus comprehensive benefits.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Perks, Why Work On the MrBeast Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are redefining what entertainment and storytelling look like at global scale. Every piece of content we publish reaches millions and influences culture in real time. This is your opportunity to lead the team that decides how those moments come to life across every screen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous Medical (Blue Cross Blue Shield), Dental, Vision and company-paid Life Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company contributions to employee Health Savings Accounts (HSA)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401k Plan with Safe Harbor company-matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible vacation policy and paid company holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-provided technology package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation assistance where applicable, including travel and company-provided housing for the first 90 days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beast Industries is a multifaceted media and entertainment company founded by Jimmy Donaldson, popularly known as MrBeast, the most watched person in the world. Renowned for revolutionizing digital content creation, Beast Industries encompasses a diverse portfolio of ventures that extend far beyond its origins on YouTube. With a mission to entertain, inspire, and create significant social impact, Beast Industries operates across various domains including digital media, philanthropy, consumer products, and innovative business initiatives. At Beast Industries, we believe in the transformative power of digital media and its potential to entertain, educate, and effect positive change. Our commitment to innovation, creativity, and philanthropy drives us to explore new frontiers, create unforgettable experiences, and build a legacy that inspires future generations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re doing an AI-first engineering rebuild for a company that already has an audience of 100M+ people. This is a zero-to-one build with no legacy constraints. You&#39;re not here to run reports or maintain someone else&#39;s dashboards. You&#39;re here to turn ambiguous product questions into clear, data-backed answers that directly shape what we build and how we grow. You&#39;ll work alongside engineers and product teams, using AI to move faster than a traditional data science workflow ever allowed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Product&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll work as part of a small, fast-moving team on the data foundation that powers product decisions across consumer products, media, gaming, and e-commerce. The work spans the full journey from raw user behavior to actionable insight. That means:&lt;br&gt;Product questions that are ambiguous, high-stakes, and time-sensitive. You need to frame them correctly before you can answer them.&lt;br&gt;A/B experiments where the design, statistical rigor, and interpretation directly determine what ships next.&lt;br&gt;A fast-moving team that moves at a pace where every analysis needs to count, and AI tools are a core part of how we get there.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;br&gt;Design and execute analyses that turn raw user behavior into actionable product insights, working closely with engineers and product teams to frame the right questions.&lt;br&gt;Own A/B experiments end to end, from experiment design and statistical analysis through to result interpretation and recommendation.&lt;br&gt;Communicate findings clearly to product and engineering stakeholders, translating complex analysis into actionable recommendations that drive product decisions.&lt;br&gt;Leverage AI tools to accelerate your workflow, from data exploration and analysis to insight delivery and iteration.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Who You Are&lt;br&gt;AI-Native: You&#39;re already using AI tools daily to move faster, from writing queries and building models to exploring data and communicating findings.&lt;br&gt;Analytical Builder: +3 years of hands-on experience in data science or analytics, with strong SQL, Python, and statistical modeling skills. You don&#39;t just analyze. You build the tooling and frameworks that make analysis repeatable and reliable.&lt;br&gt;Product Connected: You care about why you&#39;re analyzing something, not just how. You can translate vague product questions into tractable data problems and communicate findings clearly to non-technical stakeholders.&lt;br&gt;Experimentally Rigorous: You understand the principles of A/B testing, know where experiments go wrong, and hold the line on statistical rigor even under deadline pressure.&lt;br&gt;Strong SQL and Python skills, experience with A/B experimentation frameworks, and familiarity with at least one major cloud data stack (AWS, GCP, Databricks, Snowflake, or equivalent). Bonus points for experience in consumer products, media, gaming, or e-commerce, and prior work alongside product or engineering teams in a fast-moving environment.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Compensation: $178,000 –$223,000 base + equity + benefits&lt;br&gt;Hybrid Model: Expected ~3 days per week in-office (San Mateo, CA)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Perks, Why Work On the MrBeast Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are redefining what entertainment and storytelling look like at global scale. Every piece of content we publish reaches millions and influences culture in real time. This is your opportunity to lead the team that decides how those moments come to life across every screen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/li&gt;
