&lt;p data-start=&quot;972&quot; data-end=&quot;1243&quot;&gt;You will own the development and structuring of creative initiatives across brand, content, partnerships, product, and marketing. This includes defining how ideas take shape, aligning stakeholders, and driving initiatives forward from early concept to executable program.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1245&quot; data-end=&quot;1444&quot;&gt;This role requires strong creative judgment combined with operational thinking. You will work in an environment where ideas evolve quickly and require structure, clarity, and momentum to become real.&lt;/p&gt;
