&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beast Industries is a multifaceted media and entertainment company founded by Jimmy Donaldson, popularly known as MrBeast, the most watched person in the world. Renowned for revolutionizing digital content creation, Beast Industries encompasses a diverse portfolio of ventures that extend far beyond its origins on YouTube. With a mission to entertain, inspire, and create significant social impact, Beast Industries operates across various domains including digital media, philanthropy, consumer products, and innovative business initiatives. At Beast Industries, we believe in the transformative power of digital media and its potential to entertain, educate, and effect positive change. Our commitment to innovation, creativity, and philanthropy drives us to explore new frontiers, create unforgettable experiences, and build a legacy that inspires future generations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;text-text-100 mt-2 -mb-1 text-base font-bold&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the People Foundation Behind One of the Fastest-Growing Consumer Brands in the World&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Director of People for Consumer Products, you will serve as the primary people partner to a high-growth consumer goods organization, building the HR infrastructure, culture, and talent capabilities that power a scaling business. This is a high-ownership role for someone who thrives in environments where the work is still being defined and you are expected to build, not just maintain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at a rare intersection: a fast-moving, brand-led business with the operational complexity of a scaling consumer goods company. You will partner with senior leadership across commercial, supply chain, R&amp;amp;D, and operations, earning trust from corporate teams to frontline employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the full people strategy for the consumer business, building where there is nothing, adapting where the fit is not right, and holding the line on people standards when the business is moving fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary people partner to consumer business leadership, including the President and functional heads across commercial, supply chain, R&amp;amp;D, and operations&lt;/li&gt;
