&lt;li&gt;Own the publishing calendar end to end: write, package, and ship daily posts, with purpose-built rollouts for every video premiere, product drop, and announcement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Watch every video, select the clips built to travel on the platform, and brief editors on cutdowns and captions.&lt;/li&gt;
