&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beast Industries is a multifaceted media and entertainment company founded by Jimmy Donaldson, popularly known as MrBeast, the most watched person in the world. Renowned for revolutionizing digital content creation, Beast Industries encompasses a diverse portfolio of ventures that extend far beyond its origins on YouTube. With a mission to entertain, inspire, and create significant social impact, Beast Industries operates across various domains including digital media, philanthropy, consumer products, and innovative business initiatives. At Beast Industries, we believe in the transformative power of digital media and its potential to entertain, educate, and effect positive change. Our commitment to innovation, creativity, and philanthropy drives us to explore new frontiers, create unforgettable experiences, and build a legacy that inspires future generations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Opportunity&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re doing an AI-first engineering rebuild for a company that already has an audience of 100M+ people. This is a zero-to-one build with no legacy constraints. You&#39;re not here to inherit a decade of flaky tests and silent outages. You&#39;re here to build quality practices from scratch, using AI tools to move faster and catch more than was ever possible before.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Product&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll be part of a small team setting the quality bar for a consumer-facing platform shipping to millions of users. The work spans automated testing, CI/CD integration, and production monitoring across a fast-moving, AI-native engineering org.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;That means:&lt;br&gt;Automated test coverage across unit, integration, end-to-end, and performance testing that catches regressions before they reach users.&lt;br&gt;CI/CD pipelines with quality gates that give every engineer fast, reliable feedback on every commit.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;br&gt;Build and maintain automated test suites across mobile and backend surfaces, with a focus on coverage, reliability, and speed.&lt;br&gt;Integrate quality gates into CI/CD pipelines, ensuring tests run on every commit and block bad code from reaching production.&lt;br&gt;Work closely with engineers across the team to embed quality thinking into the development process, not just the release gate.&lt;br&gt;Diagnose flaky tests and production failures, then address their underlying causes.&lt;br&gt;Use AI-assisted development and testing tools to accelerate coverage, failure analysis, and test maintenance.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Who You Are&lt;br&gt;AI-Native: You&#39;re already using AI tools daily to write tests, diagnose failures, and move faster.&lt;br&gt;QA Builder: 2+ years of hands-on experience building and maintaining automated test infrastructure for consumer-facing mobile or web products.&lt;br&gt;Collaborative: You work well with engineers, communicate clearly about quality risks, and help the team ship with confidence rather than slowing them down.&lt;br&gt;Hands-on experience with test automation frameworks (Playwright, Appium, Espresso, XCTest, or equivalent), CI/CD pipelines, and at least one observability or monitoring tool. Bonus points for experience with AI-assisted QA tools, mobile app testing at consumer scale, and familiarity with SLO and error-budget concepts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;Equity: Highly competitive equity package designed for a foundational hire.&lt;br&gt;Hybrid Model: Expected ~3 days per week in-office (Bay Area or NYC).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Perks — Why Work On the MrBeast Team&lt;br&gt;We are redefining what entertainment and storytelling look like at global scale. Every piece of content we publish reaches millions and influences culture in real time. This is your opportunity to join the team that decides how those moments come to life across every screen.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;br&gt;Generous Medical (Blue Cross Blue Shield), Dental, Vision and company-paid Life Insurance&lt;br&gt;Company contributions to employee Health Savings Accounts (HSA)&lt;br&gt;401k Plan with Safe Harbor company-matching&lt;br&gt;Flexible vacation policy and paid company holidays&lt;br&gt;Company-provided technology package&lt;br&gt;Relocation assistance where applicable, including travel and company-provided housing for the first 90 days&lt;/p&gt;
