&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beast Industries is a multifaceted media and entertainment company founded by Jimmy Donaldson, popularly known as MrBeast, the most watched person in the world. Renowned for revolutionizing digital content creation, Beast Industries encompasses a diverse portfolio of ventures that extend far beyond its origins on YouTube. With a mission to entertain, inspire, and create significant social impact, Beast Industries operates across various domains including digital media, philanthropy, consumer products, and innovative business initiatives. At Beast Industries, we believe in the transformative power of digital media and its potential to entertain, educate, and effect positive change. Our commitment to innovation, creativity, and philanthropy drives us to explore new frontiers, create unforgettable experiences, and build a legacy that inspires future generations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Creator Partnerships Manager supports the full lifecycle of creator relationships across Beast Industries’ CPG brands, including Feastables, MrBeast Apparel, MrBeast Labs, and other Beast-owned properties. This role builds and maintains the creator network that makes Beast brands the ones every creator wants to work with, and ensures every partnership delivers measurable impact against strategic goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The best version of this role means creators actively want to post about Beast brands because the relationships are strong, the briefs are clear, the products resonate, the team is collaborative, and the brands give them creative room. You’re also the system builder – maintaining a 3,000+ creator database, running gifting programs at scale, managing contracts and logistics, and ensuring every partnership is on budget and ties back to a strategic goal rather than a deliverable count.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate combines relationship-building instincts with operational discipline. They understand the creator economy deeply, can evaluate creator-audience fit with nuance (beyond follower counts), and recognize that different Beast brands require different creator profiles, brief approaches, and partnership structures. Feastables will represent the highest volume of partnerships, but this role must flex across brand categories with distinct audiences and objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and identify creators aligned with campaign goals, brand voice, and audience targets across Beast-owned brands, evaluating beyond follower counts to assess audience demographics, geographic reach, engagement quality, and brand-fit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct outreach, evaluate analytics, and work closely with the Head of Content to finalize creator selection for monthly partnership activations across the portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with legal and creator management teams on contracts, redlines, usage rights, and compliance requirements for all brands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write detailed creator briefs tailored to each brand’s voice and objectives, including talking points, product highlights, brand guidelines, and creative insights that give creators enough room to be authentic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review creator content for brand alignment, brief compliance, and quality before approval; provide constructive feedback and manage revision cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate posting schedules across creators to align with product launches, seasonal campaigns, and each brand’s content calendar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage large-scale gifting initiatives across brands: concept development, mood boards, manufacturer coordination, quantity forecasting, tiered gifting strategies, creator list curation, fulfillment logistics, and tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage product delivery and shipment coordination through Supply Chain teams for both gifting and paid partnership activations across all brands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain the creator database (3,000+ contacts) with structured data including audience analytics, content performance history, rates, brand affinity, and contact information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on creator content performance monthly per brand, tying results back to brand KPIs and providing recommendations for future activations&lt;/li&gt;
