&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re doing an AI-first engineering rebuild for a company that already has an audience of 100M+ people. This is a zero-to-one build with no legacy constraints, so you get to define a modern frontend stack from scratch instead of inheriting a tangle of old code. You&#39;re here to build customer-facing experiences that millions of people actually use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Product&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll design, build, and evolve the user-facing applications at the center of the MrBeast membership ecosystem. The work is fast and AI-first, in close partnership with product and design. That means:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable, performant frontend architectures and reusable components for consumer apps with the potential to reach 100M+ people.&lt;/li&gt;
