&lt;li&gt;Partner with product managers and designers to turn requirements into clean, high-quality experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical design discussions and own architectural decisions within your domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize for performance, accessibility, responsiveness, and usability across core flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and enforce frontend standards and patterns, and drive their adoption across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers through code reviews and technical guidance, and resolve the gnarly production issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Native: &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re already using AI coding agents daily to multiply your output, and modern tooling is second nature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Frontend Builder: &lt;/strong&gt;Typically 8+ years in software engineering with serious frontend depth, building modern web apps in JavaScript and TypeScript and maintaining scalable architectures in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Minded: &lt;/strong&gt;You have a real command of performance optimization, testing strategy, accessibility, and web standards, and you can prove the wins with metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
