&lt;h1&gt;The Product&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be working, as part of a small and fast-moving team, on Vyro, a worldwide Beast Industries platform connecting creators and brands. It&#39;s a product where correctness, trust, and speed all matter at once, and where a single creator moment can drive a surge of activity through every layer of the stack. That means:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Features that must stay correct and consistent under bursty, launch-driven load, especially where the stakes are high.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A client experience that feels seamless for two very different audiences across devices and network conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Code that lives in production and gets stress-tested every time a creator moment drives a wave of new users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and ship product features across the full stack using AI coding tools, contributing to a velocity that redefines what a small engineering team can deliver.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of your features end to end, from development through deployment, using AI-facilitated QA processes and tooling to maintain high engineering quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, reliable, and performant code with a strong sense of accountability for what you ship in production, particularly where payments, verification, and content decisions are on the line.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with your teammates, contributing to a culture of high standards, fast iteration, and continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
