&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Native:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re already burning through tokens and using AI coding agents daily to move faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Stack Engineer:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of hands-on experience building consumer-facing products across frontend and backend, with comfort moving between client and server as the product demands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; You take pride in what you ship, follow through on production issues, and don&#39;t consider a feature done until it&#39;s running reliably in the hands of users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong software engineering fundamentals with hands-on experience in TypeScript across the stack: Node.js (NestJS or equivalent) on the backend and React/Next.js on the frontend, with solid grounding in event-driven architecture. Our stack includes Next.js, Python, MongoDB, RabbitMQ, and AWS (EKS, ArgoCD) with canary deployments, and a Grafana + Sentry monitoring stack for observability. Bonus points for experience with payments and payout flows, ML-assisted moderation or fraud detection, media/content pipelines, or prior work at a consumer-scale company.&lt;/p&gt;
