&lt;p&gt;You will work alongside the IT Manager to deploy enterprise technology, manage IT systems, enhance security, and contribute to key IT initiatives. This is an exciting opportunity for someone who thrives in fast-paced environments, enjoys problem-solving, and is eager to work with cutting-edge technology.&lt;/p&gt;
