&lt;p&gt;Beast Industries is a multifaceted media and entertainment company founded by Jimmy Donaldson, popularly known as MrBeast, the most watched person in the world. Renowned for revolutionizing digital content creation, Beast Industries encompasses a diverse portfolio of ventures that extend far beyond its origins on YouTube. With a mission to entertain, inspire, and create significant social impact, Beast Industries operates across various domains including digital media, philanthropy, consumer products, and innovative business initiatives. At Beast Industries, we believe in the transformative power of digital media and its potential to entertain, educate, and effect positive change. Our commitment to innovation, creativity, and philanthropy drives us to explore new frontiers, create unforgettable experiences, and build a legacy that inspires future generations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Social Media Strategy Manager is the strategic role for social media operations across Beast Industries’ CPG brands, including Feastables, MrBeast Apparel, MrBeast Labs, Lunchly, and future Beast-owned properties. This role supports the strategy that determines how each brand shows up, stays ahead of culture, and ensures the right ideas make it to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re the filter between raw creative energy and strategic execution. You work closely with the creative team to pressure-test ideas, bring trend intelligence and competitive context to the table, and drive the thoughtfulness behind every concept before it reaches the Head of Content. Your value is measured by how sharp, strategically grounded, and culturally relevant the team’s output becomes because of your influence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate thinks in systems, not just posts. They bring deep platform fluency, trend forecasting discipline, competitive rigor, and strategic instinct to know when a creative concept is right for the moment, right for the brand, and right for the audience, or when it needs to be killed, redirected, or elevated. While Feastables is the highest-volume brand in the portfolio, this role requires shifting strategy across distinctly different product categories and audiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop social media strategies for tentpole brand moments, seasonal pushes, and product launches, defining the strategic narrative, platform approach, and content mix before creative execution begins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead ongoing trend research across TikTok, Instagram, YouTube, X/Twitter, and emerging platforms, surfacing opportunities, relevant formats, sounds, and cultural moments to the creative team with context on timing and brand fit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the creative team to filter, refine, and pressure-test content concepts, bringing strategic insight, audience understanding, and competitive context to ensure the strongest ideas move forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a competitive intelligence practice: monthly audits across each brand’s category analyzing what competitors are winning attention on social, what’s falling flat, and where Beast brands have whitespace to own&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track how brands (gaming, fashion, entertainment) engage Gen Z and Gen Alpha audiences and translate relevant tactics into Beast brand-applicable strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pull and analyze social analytics from Emplifi and platform dashboards weekly and monthly, translating performance data into clear insights that inform creative direction, content mix, and platform prioritization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write detailed MrBeast channel integration briefs including talking points, product highlights, brand expectations, and retailer callouts aligned to each brand’s comms calendar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build creative decks and strategic presentations for campaign pitches, strategy updates, and cross-functional alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Creator Partnerships Manager to evaluate creator-brand fit and ensure partnership activations align with brand strategy and audience targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and refine how each Beast brand should show up on each platform, including voice, format preferences, posting cadence, and content mix, and evolve that positioning as platforms and audiences shift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute strategic input to social copy and creative briefs, ensuring platform-specific language drives conversation and shareability rather than defaulting to marketing language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a reference library of high-performing content examples from competitors, creators, and adjacent categories for team-wide learning and creative team inspiration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapt and shift between brand voices, tones, and audience contexts quickly, recognizing that what works for Feastables may not work for Apparel or Lunchly, and vice versa&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years of experience in social media strategy, content strategy, or brand strategy for consumer-facing brands&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to translate trend research and competitive analysis into actionable creative direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with experience pulling insights from social analytics platforms (Emplifi, Sprout, or similar) and translating data into strategic recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to write compelling strategic briefs and campaign frameworks that give creative teams clear direction without being prescriptive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, demonstrable fluency in internet culture, meme formats, creator ecosystems, and short-form video trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across multiple brands or products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working alongside or embedded within a creative team in a strategic advisory capacity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in or strong understanding of the MrBeast content ecosystem and creator-native video formats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with TikTok Shop content strategy or social commerce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of identifying trends early and shaping how a brand responds to them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing campaign strategies for product launches or seasonal brand moments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consumer brand, apparel, entertainment, creator economy, or agency experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Perks, Why Work On the MrBeast Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are redefining what entertainment and storytelling look like at global scale. Every piece of content we publish reaches millions and influences culture in real time. This is your opportunity to lead the team that decides how those moments come to life across every screen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous Medical (Blue Cross Blue Shield), Dental, Vision and company-paid Life Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company contributions to employee Health Savings Accounts (HSA)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401k Plan with Safe Harbor company-matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible vacation policy and paid company holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-provided technology package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation assistance where applicable, including travel and company-provided housing for the first 90 days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beast Industries is a multifaceted media and entertainment company founded by Jimmy Donaldson, popularly known as MrBeast, the most watched person in the world. Renowned for revolutionizing digital content creation, Beast Industries encompasses a diverse portfolio of ventures that extend far beyond its origins on YouTube. With a mission to entertain, inspire, and create significant social impact, Beast Industries operates across various domains including digital media, philanthropy, consumer products, and innovative business initiatives. At Beast Industries, we believe in the transformative power of digital media and its potential to entertain, educate, and effect positive change. Our commitment to innovation, creativity, and philanthropy drives us to explore new frontiers, create unforgettable experiences, and build a legacy that inspires future generations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re doing an AI-first engineering rebuild for a company that already has an audience of 100M+ people. This is a zero-to-one build with no legacy constraints, so you get to design systems from scratch. You&#39;ll build the software, services, and privacy-safe data infrastructure that power products and AI across the MrBeast ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Product&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll design, build, and run the systems that help us understand our audience and power great experiences, directly and with partners. That means:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build scalable services, APIs, and batch and real-time pipelines that power analytics, reporting, ML, and operational decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hit 99.9%+ pipeline availability and cut data delivery latency on critical datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build privacy and security into how we collect, store, access, and use data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement backend services, APIs, and distributed systems for ingesting, processing, and serving data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build batch and streaming workflows that support product features, analytics, and AI applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design data models, schemas, storage systems, and interfaces that evolve with the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize systems for performance, reliability, scalability, and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build automated tests, CI/CD pipelines, observability, and alerting to ship safely and operate confidently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, AI, and business teams to turn requirements into software and own delivery from design through production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish engineering standards for code quality, system design, data quality, privacy, and security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot production incidents and address root causes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Native: &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re already using AI in your workflow, and you understand how well-designed software and data systems enable AI and ML applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Builder: &lt;/strong&gt;Typically 8+ years designing and operating production software, with strong backend engineering, distributed systems, and data fundamentals. You&#39;re comfortable working across services, APIs, and data processing systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reliability + Quality Focused: &lt;/strong&gt;You build maintainable, well-tested software and have measurably improved system reliability, performance, and data quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Independent Leader: &lt;/strong&gt;You lead complex technical initiatives on your own and take ownership from design through operational support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience building cloud-based software and data-intensive applications is essential. Bonus points for supporting ML and AI infrastructure, streaming and event-driven architectures, private-aware system design, and metadata management, and leading technical communities of practice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity: &lt;/strong&gt;Highly competitive equity package designed for a foundational hire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Model: &lt;/strong&gt;Expected ~3 days per week in-office - San Mateo, CA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation $178,000 –$223,000 base + equity + benefits&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Perks, Why Work On the MrBeast Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are redefining what entertainment and storytelling look like at global scale. Every piece of content we publish reaches millions and influences culture in real time. This is your opportunity to lead the team that decides how those moments come to life across every screen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous Medical (Blue Cross Blue Shield), Dental, Vision and company-paid Life Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company contributions to employee Health Savings Accounts (HSA)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401k Plan with Safe Harbor company-matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible vacation policy and paid company holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-provided technology package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation assistance where applicable, including travel and company-provided housing for the first 90 days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beast Industries is a multifaceted media and entertainment company founded by Jimmy Donaldson, popularly known as MrBeast, the most watched person in the world. Renowned for revolutionizing digital content creation, Beast Industries encompasses a diverse portfolio of ventures that extend far beyond its origins on YouTube. With a mission to entertain, inspire, and create significant social impact, Beast Industries operates across various domains including digital media, philanthropy, consumer products, and innovative business initiatives. At Beast Industries, we believe in the transformative power of digital media and its potential to entertain, educate, and effect positive change. Our commitment to innovation, creativity, and philanthropy drives us to explore new frontiers, create unforgettable experiences, and build a legacy that inspires future generations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a ShortForm Creative to join the engine behind MrBeast&#39;s social presence across TikTok, Instagram Reels, and YouTube Shorts. This is not a social media management role. It&#39;s a creative production role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the connective tissue between ideation and execution. You&#39;ll write video concepts, develop them alongside producers in pre-production, and step on set as an assistant director working directly with the Head of ShortForm Creative. The three platform leads for TikTok, Instagram, and YouTube Shorts will lean on you daily to ideate, develop, and deliver content that performs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The best person for this role is obsessive about shortform content, thinks in formats and stories, has spent real time on set, and can move from a creative brief to a shoot call sheet without missing a beat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;section-label&quot;&gt;How to apply&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;We know that a resume and LinkedIn profile don&#39;t paint the entire picture of how creative you are. We&#39;ll happily take your resume but here&#39;s your opportunity to show us your skills regardless of what your experience has been. Even if you don&#39;t meet all of &quot;what we&#39;re looking for&quot;, we encourage you to apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;Record yourself walking us through your answers to 2 questions that we&#39;ll provide -- not reading a script, but showing us how you actually think. If you&#39;re taking notes or building out your thinking in a doc, show that too.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;We&#39;re not grading production value. We want to see your thought process, not how good of an editor or performer you are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;question-card&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;question-card&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready? Fill in the form below, and we&#39;ll send you more details, and a way to submit your video.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;cta-note&quot;&gt;Spots are limited. Don&#39;t sit on this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ideation &amp;amp; Writing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate a constant stream of video concepts across TikTok, Instagram Reels, and YouTube Shorts — each native to its platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clear, punchy creative briefs that give producers and editors exactly what they need to execute&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate daily with the Head of TikTok, Instagram, and Shorts to align on creative direction, formats, and priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop concepts from rough idea to fully fleshed brief — structure, hook, arc, and ending&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre-Production&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hand-in-hand with producers to build out videos from brief to shoot-ready&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to shot lists, run-of-show documents, and logistics planning for shortform shoots&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flag creative risks early and propose solutions before they become production problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On-Set Creative&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as assistant director on shortform shoots alongside the Creative Leads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the creative conscience on set — ensuring the content matches the brief and the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adapt in real time when shoots don&#39;t go to plan, keeping the creative outcome intact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scout and evaluate shoot locations alongside production, identifying the best sets and environments to elevate the content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance &amp;amp; Iteration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Study performance data across all three platforms and translate it into sharper creative decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify what&#39;s working, why it&#39;s working, and how to do more of it — fast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a data-informed point of view to every ideation session, not just gut instinct&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE&#39;RE LOOKING FOR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Real on-set experience — you understand production rhythm, know your role in a shoot, and operate well under pressure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with creators or inside a creator-led production environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency across TikTok, Instagram Reels, and YouTube Shorts — you know what makes each platform different and you use that to write better concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to write a great brief — tight hook, clear structure, platform-specific thinking, no fluff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of shortform content that actually performed, and the analytical instinct to know why&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working cross-functionally with producers, platform leads, and creative directors simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven but creatively instinctive — you can feel what&#39;s going to hit before the analytics confirm it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A communicator who can align a room, distill a note, and move things forward without friction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone who takes content personally — you want to make things people can&#39;t stop watching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wired for compressed timelines where fast is the baseline and great is still the expectation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BONUS POINTS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience assistant directing on shortform or branded content shoots&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Figma, Adobe Suite, or CapCut for concept mockups or quick edits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Perks, Why Work On the MrBeast Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are redefining what entertainment and storytelling look like at global scale. Every piece of content we publish reaches millions and influences culture in real time. This is your opportunity to lead the team that decides how those moments come to life across every screen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive Salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous Medical (Blue Cross Blue Shield), Dental, Vision and company-paid Life Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company contributions to employee Health Savings Accounts (HSA)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401k Plan with Safe Harbor company-matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible vacation policy and paid company holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-provided technology package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation assistance where applicable, including travel and company-provided housing for the first 90 days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beast Industries is a multifaceted media and entertainment company founded by Jimmy Donaldson, popularly known as MrBeast, the most watched person in the world. Renowned for revolutionizing digital content creation, Beast Industries encompasses a diverse portfolio of ventures that extend far beyond its origins on YouTube. With a mission to entertain, inspire, and create significant social impact, Beast Industries operates across various domains including digital media, philanthropy, consumer products, and innovative business initiatives. At Beast Industries, we believe in the transformative power of digital media and its potential to entertain, educate, and effect positive change. Our commitment to innovation, creativity, and philanthropy drives us to explore new frontiers, create unforgettable experiences, and build a legacy that inspires future generations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;rzkdgm&quot; data-start=&quot;1019&quot; data-end=&quot;1030&quot;&gt;About The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1032&quot; data-end=&quot;1247&quot;&gt;MrBeast is looking for a Social Media Coordinator who will support the execution and day-to-day operations of multiple consumer-facing social brands through publishing, creator coordination, community engagement, and platform-native content execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1284&quot; data-end=&quot;1571&quot;&gt;This role helps ensure brands remain active, culturally relevant, and consistently present across social platforms by managing content calendars, supporting influencer and creator partnerships, engaging directly with online communities, and maintaining fast-moving publishing operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1573&quot; data-end=&quot;1974&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate combines strong organization and project management with sharp social instincts, strong copywriting ability, and a deep understanding of internet culture, trends, memes, and Gen-Z communication styles. They are highly online, naturally curious about platform behavior, and understand how brands participate authentically in conversations happening across the internet in real time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;18w7bso&quot; data-start=&quot;2202&quot; data-end=&quot;2225&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2227&quot; data-end=&quot;3242&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;11o2hry&quot; data-start=&quot;2696&quot; data-end=&quot;2780&quot;&gt;Build and maintain social content calendars across multiple brands and campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;7twn8f&quot; data-start=&quot;2781&quot; data-end=&quot;2860&quot;&gt;Coordinate publishing workflows, approvals, and scheduling across platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1f0g5w6&quot; data-start=&quot;2861&quot; data-end=&quot;2972&quot;&gt;Publish and manage daily social content across Twitter/X, Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, and related platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;zd2uz9&quot; data-start=&quot;2973&quot; data-end=&quot;3120&quot;&gt;Help develop and evolve distinct brand voices across platforms with a focus on humor, internet-native communication, and audience participation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wkefy4&quot; data-start=&quot;3121&quot; data-end=&quot;3227&quot;&gt;Write reactive, culturally relevant social copy that drives conversation, engagement, and shareability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17vooi4&quot; data-start=&quot;3228&quot; data-end=&quot;3367&quot;&gt;Identify opportunities for brands to participate in trends, memes, and online discourse in ways that feel authentic and community-first&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;o9xqkf&quot; data-start=&quot;3368&quot; data-end=&quot;3507&quot;&gt;Engage directly with audiences through comments, replies, reposts, and community interactions to increase visibility and brand affinity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;kprwvk&quot; data-start=&quot;3508&quot; data-end=&quot;3636&quot;&gt;Support influencer and creator partnership workflows including outreach, communication, scheduling, and content coordination&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;k6ynon&quot; data-start=&quot;3637&quot; data-end=&quot;3731&quot;&gt;Manage creator communications including emails, briefs, timelines, rates, and deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14hng0g&quot; data-start=&quot;3732&quot; data-end=&quot;3820&quot;&gt;Review creator and social content submissions and provide feedback or revision notes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qmb43m&quot; data-start=&quot;3821&quot; data-end=&quot;3923&quot;&gt;Support fast-turn content execution including memes, graphics, captions, and reactive social posts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;17xddl8&quot; data-start=&quot;3924&quot; data-end=&quot;4065&quot;&gt;Build scalable systems and workflows for managing multi-brand social calendars, creator deliverables, approvals, and publishing timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sd2z2&quot; data-start=&quot;4066&quot; data-end=&quot;4187&quot;&gt;Maintain clear communication and coordination across internal stakeholders, creators, agencies, and external partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;xx64js&quot; data-start=&quot;4188&quot; data-end=&quot;4292&quot;&gt;Track publishing schedules, campaign progress, audience engagement, and social performance reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
