&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beast Industries is a multifaceted media and entertainment company founded by Jimmy Donaldson, popularly known as MrBeast, the most watched person in the world. Renowned for revolutionizing digital content creation, Beast Industries encompasses a diverse portfolio of ventures that extend far beyond its origins on YouTube. With a mission to entertain, inspire, and create significant social impact, Beast Industries operates across various domains including digital media, philanthropy, consumer products, and innovative business initiatives. At Beast Industries, we believe in the transformative power of digital media and its potential to entertain, educate, and effect positive change. Our commitment to innovation, creativity, and philanthropy drives us to explore new frontiers, create unforgettable experiences, and build a legacy that inspires future generations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;MrBeast is building one of the most powerful consumer and services ecosystems in the world, spanning media, consumer products, financial services, telecom, loyalty, and brand partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As VP of Brand Partnerships, you will originate and close high-value partnerships across this ecosystem. This role exists to convert cultural reach into revenue by structuring and securing integrated deals across media, IP, products, and experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will operate as a senior individual contributor with direct ownership of pipeline and deal outcomes. This role is designed for a leader who can source, sell, and close complex partnerships with global brands while influencing internal teams to bring those deals to life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;VP of Brand Partnerships, &lt;/strong&gt;you will be responsible for the identification, structuring, and execution of holistic brand partnerships that span branded integrations, premium media packages, IP licensing, co-productions, and product collaborations. This role operates as a senior individual contributor with direct ownership of originating and closing high-value deals with major global brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position demands a commercially driven leader capable of building and converting a pipeline of strategic opportunities, creating long-term, high-value partnerships that result in innovative and impactful 360° campaigns across Beast Industries&#39; content ecosystem and IP. Success in this role is defined by the ability to translate reach into revenue through structured, scalable partnership deals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and deliver against individual revenue targets through pipeline development, deal conversion, and closed business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively source and develop new partnership opportunities with global brands, agencies, and strategic partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead end-to-end deal cycles from outbound prospecting through negotiation and contract execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure and sell integrated partnership deals across branded content, media, IP licensing, product collaboration, and production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and present clear, outcome-driven partnership proposals aligned to partner business objectives and ROI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and grow relationships with senior stakeholders, driving renewals, upsell, and expanded partnerships over time&lt;/li&gt;
