&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate and pitch high-impact creative concepts for YouTube Shorts on a continuous basis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team of creatives and direct a dedicated writers room.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full creative lifecycle from brainstorming through post-mortem content evaluations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct and film short-form vertical content hands-on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage high-volume production schedules without sacrificing creative quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with our Social Analytics Lead to translate platform intelligence into executable creative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay obsessively current with YouTube Shorts trends, formats, and platform shifts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of the MrBeast brand and what makes content feel authentically Beast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in regular creative reviews and after-action analysis to sharpen output over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with creative, production, and social teams to bring concepts to execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE&#39;RE LOOKING FOR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine, platform-native fluency on YouTube Shorts and a clear understanding of vertical versus horizontal content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of producing vertical content that performs, whether for a creator, brand, agency, or yourself.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience filming and directing short-form content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating with prominent talent, creators, or celebrities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A calm, level-headed demeanor with the ability to manage high-volume output in a fast-paced setting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Video editing experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong creative instincts and the confidence to pitch ideas with clarity and conviction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to work at speed without sacrificing quality of thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coachability, low ego, and a genuine hunger to operate at the highest level of creative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working in a high-pressure, feedback-rich environment where the standard is world-class.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
